WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.176
The frog was hopping around the lab.

2
00:00:06.177 --> 00:00:14.237
Tom tried some more magic spells.

3
00:00:14.238 --> 00:00:22.507
But nothing worked.

4
00:00:22.508 --> 00:00:26.074
"What about a potion?" Cat asked.

5
00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:30.474
"Good idea, Cat," Tom said.

6
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:36.590
"I'll try to turn that frog into a dog."

7
00:00:36.591 --> 00:00:47.723
Tom mixed some potions.

8
00:00:47.724 --> 00:00:56.521
But none of them worked either.

9
00:00:56.522 --> 00:01:00.349
The next morning there was still no dog.

10
00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:03.292
Tom sighed.

11
00:01:03.293 --> 00:01:06.157
"I better think of something fast.

12
00:01:06.158 --> 00:01:12.238
The birthday party starts soon."

13
00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:16.137
Tom watched the frog hop around the lab.

14
00:01:16.138 --> 00:01:20.311
It hopped near a stack of books.

15
00:01:20.312 --> 00:01:22.368
"Hey!" Tom said.

16
00:01:22.369 --> 00:01:35.133
"Those are old spell books."

17
00:01:35.134 --> 00:01:42.082
Tom flipped through the spell books.

18
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:45.245
"Here’s a dog spell!" he said.

19
00:01:45.246 --> 00:01:51.646
"The queen wants a special dog," Cat reminded him.

20
00:01:51.647 --> 00:01:57.165
Tom lifted his wand. Poof!

21
00:01:57.166 --> 00:02:00.885
A dog with wings appeared!

22
00:02:00.886 --> 00:02:03.677
"I did it!" Tom said happily.

23
00:02:03.678 --> 00:02:11.165
"It's a flying dog!"

24
00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:14.047
Cat hid in Tom's pocket.

25
00:02:14.048 --> 00:02:20.301
The dog flew all around the room.

26
00:02:20.302 --> 00:02:25.699
"Wizard!" Dirk banged hard on the door.

27
00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.021
"The party is starting."

28
00:02:29.022 --> 00:02:33.633
Tom whistled. "Come on, Dog.

29
00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:37.747
It's time to go."

30
00:02:37.748 --> 00:02:43.198
The dog didn't listen to him.

31
00:02:43.199 --> 00:02:46.899
"Come on, Dog!" Tom said again.

32
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:51.277
But the dog stayed in the air.

33
00:02:51.278 --> 00:02:57.578
Cat peeked out of Tom's pocket.

34
00:02:57.579 --> 00:03:00.321
"Woof! Woof!"

35
00:03:00.322 --> 00:03:09.135
The dog flew right down at Cat!

